			"updated": 1794741782910,
			"locked": true,
			"text": "It Suggest possible Queries as the user type in the search bar . \nFor exmaple user type \"best re\" then Showing the most popular \nor trending searches with the same prefix like \n1.best restaurant near me \n2.best recipe for dinner \n3.best relaxing chair \n\nThe Main Advantage of using Auto complete system is that it enhance \nthe user experience by showing the trending searches .\n ",
