			"updated": 1794741802810,
			"locked": true,
			"text": "\n\n\n1. Finding the Data store with Prefix matching the search item \n2. Ranking all the find Relevant suggestion on the bases of frequency \n3. Regularly updating the frequncy of the serach items to make suggestion Relevat \n4. To Store the frequent seraches in the cache near by users to make the suggestion fast ",
